	(text "max inductor current should be\n~1.16 A, so saturate at 20%\nabove that and choose output cap.\n\nsee tables 9-4 & 9-5 in the datasheet\nfor recommended parts; output cap is\nnot specified, but they recommend\nX7R/X5R, low ESR/ESL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
