		(property "Description" "The RA8M2 group features 32-bit general-purpose MCUs that combine 1GHz Arm Cortex-M85 with Helium Vector Extensions and 250MHz Cortex-M33 cores, delivering over 7300 CoreMark CPU performance to meet demanding application needs. These MCUs are ideal for compute-intensive applications in industrial automation, home appliances, smart home, consumer, building/home automation, and medical/healthcare market segments.RA8M2 MCUs integrate large on-chip MRAM and SRAM memory, multiple memory interfaces, and a rich"
